## 2. Phase 1 — Stabilization

### 1B. Admissions Integration Verification
- **Files**:
  - `rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/admissions/controller/AdmissionController.java`
  - `rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/admissions/service/AdmissionService.java`
  - `frontend/src/services/apiService.ts`
- **Actions**:
  - Ensure endpoints support both `{admissionNumber}` (e.g., `ADM-1001`) and numeric ID if queried.
  - Verify that `POST /api/admissions`, `PUT /api/admissions/{admissionNumber}/confirm`, and `DELETE /api/admissions/{admissionNumber}` run within complete `@Transactional` boundaries. Room pessimistic locking is already active; verify rollback cleans up tenant and room reservation on failure.

### 1C. Tenant Integration Completion
- **Files**:
  - `rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/tenants/controller/TenantController.java`
  - `frontend/src/services/apiService.ts`
  - `frontend/src/components/tenants/TenantsView.tsx`
  - `frontend/src/App.tsx`
- **Actions**:
  - Verify `GET`, `POST`, `PUT`, `DELETE` operations on `/api/tenants` are strictly synchronized with backend.
  - Ensure tenant deletion triggers room occupancy recalculation on backend (already in place in `TenantService.deleteTenant`).
  - Eliminate any secondary manual state mutations in `App.tsx` that bypass backend refresh.

### 1D. Room Integration & Elimination of Obsolete Allocation Logic
- **Files**:
  - `frontend/src/components/rooms/RoomsView.tsx`
  - `frontend/src/App.tsx`
  - `frontend/src/services/apiService.ts`
- **Actions**:
  - **Eliminate `apiService.allocateRoom`**: Remove frontend increment arithmetic (`occupied: room.occupied + 1`) and hardcoded fake tenant generation (`+91 98000 00000`, `Bangalore`, `Software Engineer`).
  - In `RoomsView.tsx`, update the "Allocate Room" action modal:
    - Instead of creating fake tenants, selecting "Allocate" redirects to `/admissions` with the selected room pre-filled or launches the official admission flow.
  - Ensure room occupancy and availability are **100% derived from backend state** (`syncRoomOccupancy` in `RoomService`).

### 1E & 1F. Removal of Mock Business Logic & Error Handling
- **Files**:
  - `frontend/src/services/apiService.ts`
  - `rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/exception/GlobalExceptionHandler.java`
- **Actions**:
  - Remove all fallback mock mutations from `apiService.ts`.
  - Ensure all API failures return structured error messages:
    - `400`: Validation / Illegal arguments / Idempotency error
    - `404`: Resource not found
    - `409`: Conflict / Unique constraint violation
    - `500`: Internal server error (clean message, no stack trace leak)

