## 3. Phase 2 — Financial Core

```text
                        POST /api/payments
                                │
                    Idempotency Key Check
                    ┌───────────┴───────────┐
             Existing Key?              New Key
                  │                        │
        Return Existing Result        Validate Tenant & Invoice
        (Zero Duplicate Mutation)          │
                                      Check Overpayment
                                           │
                                  Create Payment Record (CASH/UPI/...)
                                           │
                                  Update Invoice (Balance & Status)
                                           │
                                  Append Immutable Ledger Entry
                                           │
                                        Commit
```

### 2A & 2B. Invoice Domain & Database Uniqueness (Phase 2B, 2C)
- **Files**:
  - `rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/billing/entity/Invoice.java`
  - `rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/billing/entity/InvoiceStatus.java`
  - `rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/billing/repository/InvoiceRepository.java`
- **Actions**:
  - Add database-level unique constraint to `Invoice`:
    ```java
    @Table(name = "invoices", uniqueConstraints = {
        @UniqueConstraint(name = "uk_invoices_tenant_month", columnNames = {"tenant_uid", "month_year"})
    })
    ```
  - Support authoritative invoice lifecycle statuses: `PENDING`, `PARTIALLY_PAID`, `PAID`, `OVERDUE`, `CANCELLED`.
  - Provide transient/computed `remainingBalance`: `Math.max(0, amount - paidAmount)`.

### 2C & 2D. Dedicated Payment Domain & Idempotency (Phase 2D, 2E)
- **Files**:
  - `[NEW] rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/billing/entity/Payment.java`
  - `[NEW] rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/billing/entity/PaymentMode.java`
  - `[NEW] rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/billing/repository/PaymentRepository.java`
  - `[NEW] rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/billing/dto/PaymentRequestDto.java`
  - `[NEW] rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/billing/dto/PaymentResponseDto.java`
- **Entity Specifications**:
  ```java
  @Entity
  @Table(name = "payments", uniqueConstraints = {
      @UniqueConstraint(name = "uk_payments_idempotency_key", columnNames = {"idempotency_key"}),
      @UniqueConstraint(name = "uk_payments_payment_ref", columnNames = {"payment_reference"})
  })
  public class Payment {
      @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
      private Long id;
      @Column(name = "payment_reference", nullable = false)
      private String paymentReference; // e.g. PAY-2026-1001
      @Column(name = "invoice_id", nullable = false)
      private Long invoiceId;
      @Column(name = "tenant_uid", nullable = false)
      private String tenantUid;
      @Column(name = "amount", nullable = false)
      private Integer amount;
      @Column(name = "payment_mode", nullable = false)
      private String paymentMode; // CASH, UPI, CARD, BANK_TRANSFER
      @Column(name = "transaction_reference")
      private String transactionReference;
      @Column(name = "idempotency_key", nullable = false)
      private String idempotencyKey;
      @Column(name = "status", nullable = false)
      private String status; // SUCCESS, FAILED
      @Column(name = "created_at", nullable = false)
      private LocalDateTime createdAt;
      @Column(name = "property_id")
      private Long propertyId;
  }
  ```

### 2E & 2F. Authoritative Payment Workflow & Idempotency Protection (Phase 2F, 2G, 2H)
- **Files**:
  - `rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/billing/service/BillingService.java`
  - `rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/billing/controller/PaymentController.java`
- **Payment Execution Algorithm**:
  1. **Idempotency Guard**:
     ```java
     Optional<Payment> existing = paymentRepository.findByIdempotencyKey(dto.getIdempotencyKey());
     if (existing.isPresent()) {
         log.info("Idempotent request detected for key {}. Returning existing payment result.", dto.getIdempotencyKey());
         return toPaymentResponseDto(existing.get(), invoice);
     }
     ```
  2. **Invoice & Tenant Validation**:
     - Check invoice exists and belongs to the given tenant.
     - Reject if invoice is already `PAID`.
  3. **Overpayment Protection**:
     - Calculate `outstanding = invoice.getAmount() - invoice.getPaidAmount()`.
     - If `dto.getAmount() > outstanding`: Throw `IllegalArgumentException("Payment amount (₹...) exceeds outstanding balance (₹...)")`.
  4. **Record Payment Entity**:
     - Save `Payment` with generated `paymentReference` (e.g. `PAY-1001`) and `idempotencyKey`.
  5. **Update Invoice Balance & Status**:
     - `int newPaid = invoice.getPaidAmount() + dto.getAmount()`.
     - `invoice.setPaidAmount(newPaid)`.
     - `invoice.setStatus(newPaid >= invoice.getAmount() ? InvoiceStatus.PAID : InvoiceStatus.PARTIALLY_PAID)`.
     - Save `Invoice`.
  6. **Create Ledger Entry (Immutable Append-Only)**:
     - Record `LedgerTransaction` of type `CREDIT` linked to `tenantUid`, `invoiceId`, and `paymentId`.
     - Compute running balance atomically.
  7. **Commit Transaction**:
     - All 3 operations (`Payment`, `Invoice`, `Ledger`) are committed within `@Transactional`.

### 2G. Ledger Enhancement (Phase 2I, 2J)
- **Files**:
  - `rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/billing/entity/LedgerTransaction.java`
  - `rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/billing/repository/LedgerTransactionRepository.java`
  - `rms-backend/src/main/java/com/rms/backend/billing/controller/LedgerController.java`
- **Enhancements**:
  - Add fields to `LedgerTransaction`:
    - `tenant_uid` (`String`)
    - `invoice_id` (`Long`)
    - `payment_id` (`Long`)
  - Add repository & controller queries:
    - `GET /api/ledger/tenant/{tenantUid}`
    - `GET /api/ledger/invoice/{invoiceId}`
  - Keep historical ledger entries immutable.

### 2H. Frontend Finance Integration (Phase 2L, 2M)
- **Files**:
  - `frontend/src/services/apiService.ts`
  - `frontend/src/components/finance/RentBillingView.tsx`
  - `frontend/src/types.ts`
- **Actions**:
  - Add `Payment` interface to `types.ts`.
  - Add `recordPayment` in `apiService.ts` that includes a client-generated UUID `idempotencyKey` (e.g. `PAY-KEY-${invoiceId}-${Date.now()}-${uuid()}`).
  - In `RentBillingView.tsx`:
    - Ensure recording payment (cash, UPI, etc.) disables the submit button during submission to prevent UI double-clicks, while relying on the backend idempotency key as the authoritative guard.
    - Refresh invoices, ledger transactions, and dashboard stats upon completion.

